{"id":"torrey:feast-of-tabernacles-the","source":"torrey","name":"Feast Of Tabernacles, The","slug":"feast-of-tabernacles-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Held after harvest and vintage — De 16:13.","refs":[["Deut",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"Began fifteenth of seventh month — Le 23:34,39.","refs":[["Lev",23,34,23,34],["Lev",23,39,23,39]]},{"text":"Lasted seven days — Le 23:34,41; De 16:13,15.","refs":[["Lev",23,34,23,34],["Lev",23,41,23,41],["Deut",16,13,16,13],["Deut",16,15,16,15]]},{"text":"Called the feast of ingathering — Ex 23:16,17.","refs":[["Exod",23,16,23,16],["Exod",23,17,23,17]]},{"text":"All males obliged to appear at — Ex 23:16,17.","refs":[["Exod",23,16,23,16],["Exod",23,17,23,17]]},{"text":"First and last days of, holy convocations — Le 23:35,39; Nu 29:12,35.","refs":[["Lev",23,35,23,35],["Lev",23,39,23,39],["Num",29,12,29,12],["Num",29,35,29,35]]},{"text":"Sacrifices during — Le 23:36,37; Nu 29:13-39.","refs":[["Lev",23,36,23,36],["Lev",23,37,23,37],["Num",29,13,29,39]]},{"text":"With rejoicing. — De 16:14,15.","refs":[["Deut",16,14,16,14],["Deut",16,15,16,15]]},{"text":"Perpetually. — Le 23:41.","refs":[["Lev",23,41,23,41]]},{"text":"The people dwelt in booths during — Le 23:42; Ne 8:15,16.","refs":[["Lev",23,42,23,42],["Neh",8,15,8,15],["Neh",8,16,8,16]]},{"text":"The law publicly read every seventh year at — De 31:10-12; Ne 8:18.","refs":[["Deut",31,10,31,12],["Neh",8,18,8,18]]},{"text":"Bearing branches of palms. — Le 23:40; Re 7:9.","refs":[["Lev",23,40,23,40],["Rev",7,9,7,9]]},{"text":"Drawing water from the pool of Siloam. — Isa 12:3; Joh 7:2,37-39.","refs":[["Isa",12,3,12,3],["John",7,2,7,2],["John",7,37,7,39]]},{"text":"Singing hosannas. — Ps 118:24-29; Mt 21:8,9.","refs":[["Ps",118,24,118,29],["Matt",21,8,21,8],["Matt",21,9,21,9]]},{"text":"To commemorate the sojourn of Israel in the desert — Le 23:43.","refs":[["Lev",23,43,23,43]]},{"text":"At the dedication of Solomon’s temple. — 1Ki 8:2,65.","refs":[["1Kgs",8,2,8,2],["1Kgs",8,65,8,65]]},{"text":"After the captivity. — Ex 3:4; Ne 8:17.","refs":[["Exod",3,4,3,4],["Neh",8,17,8,17]]}],"refCount":39}
